  <head>Fieldwork in Saudi Arabia</head>
  <p>Gunda Kinzl went to explore the dialects of Saudi Arabia. She
  encountered wonderful people, an unexpectedly, breathtakingly,
  beautiful nature and many interesting linguistic features.</p>
